class LamportClock {
  constructor() { this.time = 0; }
  tick() { return ++this.time; }
  receive(remote) {
    this.time = Math.max(this.time, remote) + 1;
    return this.time;
  }
}
```
Trace: A local event → A=1. A sends → A=2 (message carries 2). B is at 4, receives → `max(4,2)+1 = 5`. B sends → B=6 (carries 6). A receives → `max(2,6)+1 = 7`.

Final: **A = 7, B = 6**.
